       "Matt.2.22"
      ],
      "text": "The southern hill country, containing Jerusalem and Bethlehem."
     },
     {
      "term": "Galilee",
      "refs": [
       "Matt.2.22"
      ],
      "text": "The northern region, containing Nazareth. After Herod’s death it was governed separately from Judaea, by Herod Antipas."
     },
     {
      "term": "Egypt",
      "refs": [
       "Matt.2.13"
      ],
      "text": "A Roman province from 30 BC. Matthew does not name a city there."
